<title>USA: Carolina Power sees Harris unit back Sat..</title>
<headline>Carolina Power sees Harris unit back Sat..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina Power &amp; Light Co said Friday it expects to restart its 880 megawatt (MW) Harris 1 nuclear power plant within the next day.</p>
<p>&quot;The restart should be in about 24 hours,&quot; said company spokeswoman Michelle Warren.  </p>
<p>The unit tripped off line Thursday due to a low water level in its steam generator.</p>
<p>The Harris nuclear facility is in New Hill, N.C.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk + 212 859 1628))</p>
